class vsWeakPointer<T>
    doc A pointer to a T that turns null when the T is deleted. Kept inside other objects, 0x18 bytes.
    size 0x18
    doc Seen through mmoNPCAdvertisement's npc (at +0x128), set up field by field by mmoToon::GetSelfAdvertisements.
    field 0x0 vtable void*
        seen mmoToon::GetSelfAdvertisements()+0x1d0
    field 0x8 object T*
        doc The T, while it exists: check proxy first.
        seen mmoToon::GetSelfAdvertisements()+0x1ac
    field 0x10 proxy void**
        doc Shared with the T; its first word is 0 once the T is gone.
        seen mmoToon::GetSelfAdvertisements()+0x1b7
